{"design":{"context":"视频情境是蓝衣男子投篮出手后、篮球尚未触网的短暂窗口。本小游戏把该情境抽象为一个自绘的篮球标记与篮筐目标，不读取或追踪真实视频像素：玩家在球场区域用一次水平短滑模拟拨腕，篮球标记会沿自绘轨迹朝篮筐微调。","goal":"在限定时间内完成一次方向正确、力度适中的水平短滑，使自绘篮球标记落入篮筐中心区。","goal_note":"篮筐、篮球、偏移量和轨迹均为新增游戏设计，不代表视频中人物或球的真实空间测量。","screen":"透明背景上的纵向游戏面板。顶部显示“末端拨球”和操作提示；中部是自适应球场区域，右侧绘制篮筐与半透明中心区，左侧绘制篮球标记；篮球与篮筐之间显示预置的横向偏移提示；底部显示当前滑动方向、力度条和剩余时间。","input":"玩家在球场区域按住鼠标或触屏并进行一次水平滑动。有效成功输入为：向右滑动，水平位移24至96像素（含边界），且水平位移至少为垂直位移的1.2倍。未命中、方向错误、力度不足或过大的滑动均失败。pointercancel、失去有效指针、垂直滑动或达到8秒时限均判定失败。","rules":"本游戏只接受一次有效拨腕操作。自绘篮球初始位于篮筐左侧，因此预期方向为向右；这是新增标记相对自绘目标的设计，不声称是视频中球的实际偏移。成功条件为：滑动方向向右；水平位移大于等于24像素且小于等于96像素；水平位移不小于垂直位移绝对值的1.2倍；滑动结束时仍处于进行状态。滑动距离小于24像素为力度不足，大于96像素为过猛，方向向左为反向拨动，垂直位移占优为非水平操作。pointercancel或指针异常取消按失败处理；未操作或未完成有效滑动持续到8秒按超时失败。所有判定均基于Pointer Events的屏幕坐标差值和游戏容器内的自绘目标，不使用厘米、真实空间位置或外部追踪结果。","states":"准备→进行→成功/失败→结束。准备状态显示操作说明并等待第一次pointerdown；pointerdown后进入进行状态并记录起点；pointermove更新方向和力度提示；pointerup、pointercancel或超时后进入成功或失败状态；调用api.finish后锁定输入，进入结束状态并由宿主负责1秒反馈和原片继续。","feedback":"成功时显示“精准拨球”，自绘篮球沿柔和弧线滑入篮筐中心区，并显示短暂高亮；失败时显示对应原因，如“拨反方向”“力度不足”“力度过大”“非水平拨动”“操作已取消”或“未在时限内完成”，自绘篮球停在原处或偏离篮筐，并可出现轻微抖动。宿主统一显示反馈1秒后恢复视频，不产生剧情分支。","timeout_s":8},"javascript":"function mount(container, api) {
  var root = document.createElement('div');
  root.id = 'game';
  root.className = 'pickle-game';
  container.appendChild(root);

  var heading = document.createElement('div');
  heading.className = 'game-heading';
  var title = document.createElement('strong');
  title.textContent = '末端拨球';
  var subtitle = document.createElement('span');
  subtitle.textContent = '向右短滑，修正自绘篮球的落点';
  heading.appendChild(title);
  heading.appendChild(subtitle);

  var playfield = document.createElement('div');
  playfield.className = 'playfield';
  var court = document.createElement('div');
  court.className = 'court';
  var hoop = document.createElement('div');
  hoop.className = 'hoop';
  var hoopInner = document.createElement('div');
  hoopInner.className = 'hoop-inner';
  hoop.appendChild(hoopInner);
  var target = document.createElement('div');
  target.className = 'target-zone';
  target.textContent = '篮心';
  var ball = document.createElement('div');
  ball.className = 'ball';
  ball.textContent = '●';
  var lane = document.createElement('div');
  lane.className = 'lane';
  var gesture = document.createElement('div');
  gesture.className = 'gesture-line';
  var info = document.createElement('div');
  info.className = 'info';
  var status = document.createElement('div');
  status.className = 'status';
  status.textContent = '在球场区域按住并向右短滑';
  var meter = document.createElement('div');
  meter.className = 'meter';
  var meterFill = document.createElement('div');
  meterFill.className = 'meter-fill';
  meter.appendChild(meterFill);
  var timeLabel = document.createElement('div');
  timeLabel.className = 'time-label';
  timeLabel.textContent = '剩余 8.0 秒';

  court.appendChild(lane);
  court.appendChild(target);
  court.appendChild(hoop);
  court.appendChild(ball);
  court.appendChild(gesture);
  playfield.appendChild(court);
  info.appendChild(status);
  info.appendChild(meter);
  info.appendChild(timeLabel);
  root.appendChild(heading);
  root.appendChild(playfield);
  root.appendChild(info);

  var state = 'ready';
  var finished = false;
  var pointerId = null;
  var startX = 0;
  var startY = 0;
  var currentX = 0;
  var currentY = 0;
  var startedAt = Date.now();
  var timerHandle = null;
  var timeoutHandle = null;
  var SUCCESS_MIN = 24;
  var SUCCESS_MAX = 96;
  var SUCCESS_RATIO = 1.2;
  var EXPECTED_DIRECTION = 1;

  function setText(node, text) {
    node.textContent = text;
  }

  function updateClock() {
    var elapsed = (Date.now() - startedAt) / 1000;
    var remaining = Math.max(0, 8 - elapsed);
    timeLabel.textContent = '剩余 ' + remaining.toFixed(1) + ' 秒';
    meterFill.style.width = (remaining / 8 * 100) + '%';
    if (remaining <= 0) {
      fail('未在时限内完成', 'timeout');
    }
  }

  function resetGesture() {
    pointerId = null;
    gesture.style.width = '0px';
    gesture.style.opacity = '0';
  }

  function finish(result, message, visual) {
    if (finished) return;
    finished = true;
    state = 'ended';
    if (timerHandle !== null) {
      clearInterval(timerHandle);
      timerHandle = null;
    }
    if (timeoutHandle !== null) {
      clearTimeout(timeoutHandle);
      timeoutHandle = null;
    }
    if (visual === 'success') {
      ball.classList.add('ball-success');
      hoop.classList.add('hoop-success');
      status.textContent = '精准拨球';
    } else {
      ball.classList.add('ball-fail');
      status.textContent = message;
    }
    gesture.style.opacity = '0';
    api.finish({result: result, message: message});
  }

  function fail(message, kind) {
    if (finished) return;
    if (kind === 'timeout') {
      ball.classList.add('ball-fail');
    } else if (kind === 'cancel') {
      ball.classList.add('ball-fail');
    } else if (kind === 'wrong') {
      ball.classList.add('ball-left');
    } else if (kind === 'short') {
      ball.classList.add('ball-shake');
    } else if (kind === 'long') {
      ball.classList.add('ball-far');
    } else {
      ball.classList.add('ball-fail');
    }
    finish('failure', message, 'failure');
  }

  function onPointerDown(event) {
    if (finished || state === 'ended') return;
    if (pointerId !== null) return;
    if (event.pointerType === 'mouse' && event.button !== 0) return;
    pointerId = event.pointerId;
    startX = event.clientX;
    startY = event.clientY;
    currentX = event.clientX;
    currentY = event.clientY;
    state = 'playing';
    status.textContent = '向右短滑，松开完成拨腕';
    gesture.style.opacity = '1';
    if (court.setPointerCapture) {
      try { court.setPointerCapture(pointerId); } catch (e) {}
    }
    event.preventDefault();
  }

  function onPointerMove(event) {
    if (finished || pointerId !== event.pointerId) return;
    currentX = event.clientX;
    currentY = event.clientY;
    var dx = currentX - startX;
    var dy = currentY - startY;
    var width = court.getBoundingClientRect().width;
    var x = Math.max(0, Math.min(width, startX - court.getBoundingClientRect().left + dx));
    gesture.style.left = (startX - court.getBoundingClientRect().left) + 'px';
    gesture.style.top = (startY - court.getBoundingClientRect().top) + 'px';
    gesture.style.width = Math.max(0, Math.abs(dx)) + 'px';
    gesture.style.transform = 'rotate(' + (dx >= 0 ? 0 : 180) + 'deg)';
    if (Math.abs(dx) >= SUCCESS_MIN) {
      status.textContent = dx > 0 ? '方向正确，继续保持短距离' : '方向相反，篮球会偏出篮心';
    } else {
      status.textContent = '再向右拨一点';
    }
    event.preventDefault();
  }

  function onPointerUp(event) {
    if (finished || pointerId !== event.pointerId) return;
    var dx = event.clientX - startX;
    var dy = event.clientY - startY;
    var horizontal = Math.abs(dx);
    var vertical = Math.abs(dy);
    var direction = dx === 0 ? 0 : (dx > 0 ? 1 : -1);
    resetGesture();
    if (horizontal < SUCCESS_MIN) {
      fail('力度不足', 'short');
      return;
    }
    if (horizontal > SUCCESS_MAX) {
      fail('力度过大', 'long');
      return;
    }
    if (horizontal < vertical * SUCCESS_RATIO) {
      fail('非水平拨动', 'vertical');
      return;
    }
    if (direction !== EXPECTED_DIRECTION) {
      fail('拨反方向', 'wrong');
      return;
    }
    ball.style.left = '68%';
    ball.style.top = '38%';
    finish('success', '精准拨球', 'success');
    event.preventDefault();
  }

  function onPointerCancel(event) {
    if (finished || pointerId !== event.pointerId) return;
    resetGesture();
    fail('操作已取消', 'cancel');
    event.preventDefault();
  }

  court.addEventListener('pointerdown', onPointerDown);
  court.addEventListener('pointermove', onPointerMove);
  court.addEventListener('pointerup', onPointerUp);
  court.addEventListener('pointercancel', onPointerCancel);
  court.addEventListener('lostpointercapture', onPointerCancel);
  timerHandle = setInterval(updateClock, 50);
  timeoutHandle = setTimeout(function () { fail('未在时限内完成', 'timeout'); }, 8000);

  return {
    destroy: function () {
      if (timerHandle !== null) clearInterval(timerHandle);
      if (timeoutHandle !== null) clearTimeout(timeoutHandle);
      court.removeEventListener('pointerdown', onPointerDown);
      court.removeEventListener('pointermove', onPointerMove);
      court.removeEventListener('pointerup', onPointerUp);
      court.removeEventListener('pointercancel', onPointerCancel);
      court.removeEventListener('lostpointercapture', onPointerCancel);
      if (root.parentNode) root.parentNode.removeChild(root);
    }
  };
}","css":"#game { position: relative; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-height: 360px; overflow: hidden; box-sizing: border-box; color: #f7fbff; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; background: rgba(8, 20, 38, 0.72); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.16); border-radius: 18px; }
#game * { box-sizing: border-box; }
#game .game-heading { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; padding: 16px 20px 10px; }
#game .game-heading strong { font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
#game .game-heading span { color: rgba(235,244,255,0.78); font-size: 13px; }
#game .playfield { position: absolute; inset: 72px 14px 104px; min-height: 150px; }
#game .court { position: relative; width: 100%; height: 100%; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 14px; background: linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(28,76,120,0.72), rgba(8,27,52,0.92)); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); touch-action: none; user-select: none; }
#game .court:before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 8%; right: 8%; bottom: 17%; height: 1px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); }
#game .lane { position: absolute; left: 24%; top: 48%; width: 44%; height: 3px; transform: translateY(-50%); background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,210,92,0.75) 0 14px, transparent 14px 25px); opacity: 0.7; }
#game .target-zone { position: absolute; left: 68%; top: 27%; width: 18%; height: 38%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); border: 2px solid rgba(255,218,107,0.88); border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(255,196,75,0.16); display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center; padding-bottom: 5px; color: rgba(255,240,190,0.9); font-size: 11px; }
#game .hoop { position: absolute; left: 68%; top: 43%; width: 18%; height: 9%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); border: 3px solid #ff9b45; border-top: 0; border-radius: 0 0 45% 45%; background: transparent; }
#game .hoop-inner { position: absolute; left: 12%; right: 12%; bottom: -8px; height: 3px; background: #ffcf70; border-radius: 3px; }
#game .ball { position: absolute; left: 52%; top: 43%; width: 34px; height: 34px; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); border-radius: 50%; background: radial-gradient(circle at 34% 30%, #ffd77a 0 10%, #e98232 11% 70%, #9b3f20 71%); box-shadow: 0 5px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.38); color: transparent; transition: left 520ms cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1), top 520ms cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1), transform 520ms ease; }
#game .ball-success { left: 68% !important; top: 38% !important; transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1.12); box-shadow: 0 0 0 7px rgba(255,218,107,0.24), 0 6px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.42); }
#game .hoop-success { border-color: #fff0a1; box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(255,220,100,0.8); }
#game .ball-fail { opacity: 0.82; }
#game .ball-left { left: 25% !important; transition: left 420ms ease; }
#game .ball-far { left: 86% !important; transition: left 420ms ease; }
#game .ball-shake { animation: game-shake 280ms ease; }
#game .gesture-line { position: absolute; height: 3px; transform-origin: left center; transform: rotate(0deg); background: rgba(116,220,255,0.92); border-radius: 3px; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; }
#game .info { position: absolute; left: 20px; right: 20px; bottom: 14px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; grid-template-rows: auto 8px auto; column-gap: 12px; row-gap: 7px; align-items: center; }
#game .status { grid-column: 1 / 3; min-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: #e7f4ff; }
#game .meter { grid-column: 1; width: 100%; height: 8px; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 8px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); }
#game .meter-fill { width: 100%; height: 100%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #55d8ff, #ffd166); border-radius: inherit; transition: width 80ms linear; }
#game .time-label { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 2; min-width: 88px; text-align: right; font-size: 12px; color: rgba(235,244,255,0.8); }
@keyframes game-shake { 0%,100% { margin-left: 0; } 25% { margin-left: -8px; } 75% { margin-left: 8px; } }
@media (max-width: 520px) { #game .game-heading { padding: 12px 14px 8px; } #game .game-heading strong { font-size: 18px; } #game .playfield { inset: 64px 10px 100px; } #game .info { left: 14px; right: 14px; } #game .target-zone { width: 21%; } #game .hoop { width: 21%; } }"}

